# Shuttlecraft Galileo ({3}{W}): landfall makes a 1/1 red Officer; Station taps another creature for charge counters equal to
# its power, and at 6+ the Spacecraft is an artifact creature with flying; its attack trigger gives up to seven attacking
# creatures flying. A Quakestrider Ceratops (12 power) stations it on turn 3, so Galileo is a flying 3/3, and its attack
# gives the Officer flying too.

